{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p004945","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p004945"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p004945","label":"楚王被虜未名（蒙恬列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"楚王","mention_ids":["c-shiji-088-mengtian:m001-0171"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-088-mengtian:m001-0171","chapter_id":"c-shiji-088-mengtian","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-088-mengtian:p001","quote":"楚王"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-088-mengtian:m001-0171","start":171,"end":173,"surface":"楚王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004945","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-088-mengtian:p001","chapter_id":"c-shiji-088-mengtian"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji088-009","person_id":"cbr-p004945","surfaces":["楚王"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-088-mengtian"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-088-mengtian:p001","quote":"蒙恬者，其先齊人也。恬大父蒙驁，自齊事秦昭王，官至上卿。秦莊襄王元年，蒙驁為秦將，伐韓，取成皋、滎陽，作置三川郡。二年，蒙驁攻趙，取三十七城。始皇三年，蒙驁攻韓，取十三城。五年，蒙驁攻魏，取二十城，作置東郡。始皇七年，蒙驁卒。驁子曰武，武子曰恬。恬嘗書獄典文學。始皇二十三年，蒙武為秦裨將軍，與王翦攻楚，大破之，殺項燕。二十四年，蒙武攻楚，虜楚王。蒙恬弟毅。"}],"rationale":"依蒙氏世系與任職敘事局部承接暫接；驁、武、恬、毅限本段或局部語境，不作全域字串匹配。秦王與帝按始皇前後敘事暫接；被虜楚王與趙高母保留未名，隱宮宦籍不另補身分。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-088-mengtian:p001","text":"蒙恬者，其先齊人也。恬大父蒙驁，自齊事秦昭王，官至上卿。秦莊襄王元年，蒙驁為秦將，伐韓，取成皋、滎陽，作置三川郡。二年，蒙驁攻趙，取三十七城。始皇三年，蒙驁攻韓，取十三城。五年，蒙驁攻魏，取二十城，作置東郡。始皇七年，蒙驁卒。驁子曰武，武子曰恬。恬嘗書獄典文學。始皇二十三年，蒙武為秦裨將軍，與王翦攻楚，大破之，殺項燕。二十四年，蒙武攻楚，虜楚王。蒙恬弟毅。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-088-mengtian:m001-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"蒙恬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004937","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-088-mengtian:m001-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"其先","kind":"unresolved","per